"In 1963 Earth accepted Artonan magic, technology and a promise of future protection."
"The agreement was made with the Artonan Triplanetary Government."
"It made Earth an Artonan resource world, with that designation's rights and duties."
"Every selectee hears these terms in the System's selection speech."
"Accepting is said to satisfy a portion of the world's debt to the Triplanets."
"Artonans must give Earth a set amount of magic and technology, but need not explain it."
"The intervention threshold is lower for many other species."
"The UN usually asks the Artonans for help with famines and disasters."
